      "trackName": "Word Puzzle Watch",
      "description": "Word Puzzle Watch brings classic word search fun to your  Watch. Find hidden words in a grid of letters by dragging your finger across the screen.\n\nFeatures:\n- 15 categories with 10-23 chapters each\n- Hundreds of words to discover\n- Watch-optimized controls with smooth drag-to-select\n- Timer-based gameplay with star ratings\n- Smart word placement algorithm for unique puzzles\n- Sound effects and visual feedback\n- Hint system when you get stuck\n- Track your progress with scores and star ratings\n- No internet required - play anywhere\n\nCategories include Animals, Food, Colors, Clothes, Tools, Aircraft, Astronomy, Beach, Farm, Nature, Science, School, Sports, Cities, and Flowers.",
